 # Changelog
 
+## 0.5.0
+
+Additive. `LegalGate` and the default `LegalDocumentBody` output are unchanged.
+
+- `LegalDocumentBody` `highlightPattern` and `renderPlaceholder` (#715), and `LEGAL_FILL_PATTERN` (`[[FILL: ...]]`): matching text renders as `<mark class="rk-legal-placeholder" data-placeholder="">` or through the app's renderer, in Markdown text, headings, list items and `format: "text"`. Placeholders are atomic; Markdown inside a match is not interpreted.
+- `manifestGateLinks(documents, { shortTitles?, excludeRoles? })` and `ManifestDocumentLike` (#394): the legal manifest's documents as link-only gate documents.
+- `policyGateDocuments(documents, urls?)`: `urls` may also be the manifest's documents, matched by `role` then `title`; `DefaultPolicyDocumentLike.role` is optional. A record keyed by title still works.
+
 ## 0.4.0 (2026-10-17)
 
 Additive (bogusyogi/rightkit#470). `LegalGate` props are unchanged.
