 # Changelog
 
+## 0.4.0
+
+Additive. Existing components and the default markup are unchanged. Both new components are in the root entry and never import `fabric`.
+
+- `MediaThumbnail` (#714): a non-interactive tile face for a video or audio file. Video: a muted, paused, controlless metadata `<video>` showing one frame (`frameTime`, default 0.1 s, as a `#t=` media fragment), with `poster`, optional `showDuration`, `onDuration` and `onError`. Audio: artwork (`poster`) or a note glyph. It takes no focus and ignores pointer events, so the host's tile button owns the click. Decorative (aria-hidden) unless `label` is given. Sources go through the `resolveSrc` adapter. Classes `rk-media-thumb*`.
+- `MaskPainter` (#716): brush and eraser over an image on a canvas at the image's natural size, pointer input (mouse, pen, touch). The host drives `tool`, `brushSize`, `maskColor`, `maskOpacity` and calls the `handleRef` handle: `exportPng({ format: "white-on-black" | "alpha", threshold })`, `clear()`, `undo()`, `canUndo()`, `hasMask()`, `canvas()`. Undo keeps up to `maxUndo` (default 10, 0 = off) snapshots. The package renders no toolbar. Classes `rk-mask*`.
+- Pure helpers `maskCanvasPoint`, `maskBrushDiameter`, `maskPixelsForExport`, `maskHasPaint` and types `MaskExportFormat`, `MaskPoint`, `MaskRect`.
+
 ## 0.3.4
 
 - Fix (regression in 0.3.3): with the image stage focused (any click on the image focuses it), Left/Right no longer paged through the folder, because the stage consumed every arrow key. The stage now handles arrow keys only while the image can pan (zoomed past fit); at fit they are left unhandled, so folder paging receives them as in 0.3.2.
