index decc7d8..5fbe082 100644
--- a/packages/pdf-ui/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/packages/pdf-ui/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,17 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## 0.3.0
+
+Additive (#396). Every new option defaults to the 0.2.0 behaviour; default `PdfViewer` markup is unchanged (the characterization snapshots are not regenerated).
+
+- Range transport: `PdfRangeSource` (`{ kind: "range", length, read(begin, end), initialData?, revision? }`) is accepted as `PdfViewer`'s `source`, so a large file is read by the byte ranges pdf.js asks for. Headless: `createPdfRangeTransport(source, onError?)` (a pdf.js `PDFDataRangeTransport` over `read`, with `dispose()`) and `pdfRangeDocumentInit(handle, length, documentOptions?)`. `PdfSource` itself is unchanged.
+- Password flow parity: `attachPasswordHandler(task, getHandler, timer?, { initialPassword?, onCancel? })`. `initialPassword` answers the first request without the handler (a bench or stored password; a wrong one falls back to the handler; no handler needed). `onCancel` runs once when the flow ends the load. `PdfViewer` props `password` and `onPasswordCancel` pass them.
+- Page unload: `PdfViewer` `unloadPages` (`true` or `{ marginPx }`) removes the canvas and text layer of pages far outside the scroll area and renders them again on return; placeholder sizes are kept.
+- Links: `PdfViewer` `linkLayer` draws a box per Link annotation (URL through `adapters.openExternal`, http(s)/mailto only; destinations and page actions navigate). Headless: `renderPdfLinkLayer(page, container, viewport, linkService)`. Classes `rk-pdf-links`, `rk-pdf-link`.
+- Search options: `PdfViewer` `searchOptions` (initial `matchCase`, `wholeWord`, `regex`), `searchOptionsUi` (Match case and Whole word checkboxes) and `onSearchOptionsChange`.
+- Edit layers: `PdfViewer` `pageLayers(info)` mounts a host layer on each rendered page (`PdfPageLayerInfo`: `pageNumber`, pdf.js `page`, `viewport`, `slot`) and runs the returned cleanup on unload, re-render or unmount. The package ships no editor; a host builds pdf.js's annotation editor layer in this slot.
+- Text-content source for `renderPdfTextLayer` (`streamTextContent`) and regex find were already in 0.1.6 and 0.2.0.
+
 ## 0.2.0 (2026-10-17)
 
 Fix and additive options (Orthic-Labs/rightkit#273, #396). Default output is unchanged.
