 # Changelog
 
+## 0.3.1
+
+Additive.
+
+- The root entry re-exports the toast bus (#759): `createToastBus`, `defaultToastBus`, `toast`, `DEFAULT_TOAST_TTL` and the types `Toast`, `ToastAction`, `ToastBus`, `ToastBusOptions`, `ToastEvent`, `ToastKind`, `ToastOptions`. They were `./headless` only. The bus is dependency-free, so the root entry still loads no `plugin-os` until `loadPlatform` runs. The same objects are shared between the two entries inside one bundle.
+- `chordFromEvent(event, { modifiers, platform })`, `isModifierKey(key)` (root and `./headless`, #426): the canonical chord string for a keydown, for a shortcut recorder; `null` for a modifier-only press. `modifiers: "mod"` writes Cmd (macOS) or Ctrl (elsewhere) as `mod`.
+- `usePersistedState(key, initial, options)` and `readPersisted`, `writePersisted`, `clearPersisted` (`./headless`, #426): storage-backed state that never throws (private mode, quota, SSR fall back to memory), with optional `validate`, custom (de)serialising and cross-tab sync.
+- `installHoverGuard(doc?, { attribute })` (root and `./headless`, #426): sets `data-hover-guard` on the root while a WebView2 `:hover` may be stale (window blur, pointer left the document) and clears it on the next pointer move; scope hover rules with `:root:not([data-hover-guard])`.
+
 ## 0.3.0 (2026-10-17)
 
 Additive. Every new option defaults to the 0.2.8 behaviour.
