 # Changelog
 
+## 0.7.0
+
+Additive. With no new prop set, existing markup is unchanged. Closes #394, #620, #730 and #754 (settings-ui parts).
+
+- `@rightkit/settings-ui/unstyled` (#394): `SettingsFrame`, `UpdatesView`, `updateStatusText`, `LegalLinksView`, `AboutView`, `DiagnosticsView`. Imports only `react`, adds no `rk-` class.
+- `SelectBox` and `PathPicker` (#754), exported from the root and `/core`. `PathPicker` takes an injected `pick()`.
+- `SettingsModal`, `parseSettingsHash`, `formatSettingsHash` (#620), exported from the root and `/core`: `role="dialog"` host with focus trap and restore, Escape and backdrop close, dirty banner, Reload / Discard / Save footer, discard confirmation, `pending` lock, optional `#settings=<id>` deep link, header `title`/`subtitle`, `footer` slot.
+- `SettingRow` `proGate` and `ProGate` type (#730): Pro badge, locked control (disabled fieldset), reason, Upgrade button.
+- `IndexProgress` (#730): one-line progress ("Indexing: 120 / 400") with a bar; idle text when not running.
+- `modelsSection` (#730, #754): `disabled` (boolean or per model, string = reason), `disabledNote`, `showStatus`, `statusLabels`, `actions` (extra per-row actions). A disabled row keeps its install-state badge visible.
+- `doctorSection` is generic over the probe report and takes `probe` and `notes` (#754). `DoctorOptions<P = undefined>`.
+- `diagnosticsSection` `logTail` (`LogTailOptions`, `LogTailFile`) and `tailLines` (#730): multi-file tail preview with a Reveal action per file.
+
 ## 0.6.0 (2026-10-17)
 
 - Updates section: show the new @rightkit/app-update `staged` status (downloaded, waiting for the install go-ahead).
